{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S08-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B1.1\", \"B1.2\", \"B1.3\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"前一段被唤起的渴望，在喜欢的畅快中转成直接舒展的歌唱：他不再分析或防卫，情绪随着歌句不断抬高，熟悉的摇荡也仿佛在催促他尽情投入，那份急切由此成为满足。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S08-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B2.1\", \"B2.2\", \"B2.3\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"这份畅快还有轻盈、透气的一面：身体重新有了弹性，人也显出玩心，渴望不再只是急切地追求，而成为轻快的调情与回应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [],\n      \"beads\": [\"B3.1\", \"B3.2\", \"B3.3\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"歌声在第69–70小节向上散去，到了第71小节又忽然没有下文；当沉醉的歌唱中断时，快乐尚未完全结束，人却已经开始怀念它。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"explains\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"],\n      \"why\": \"B1呈现了畅快如何使歌唱变得直接舒展、让情绪不断抬高，并使急切转为满足；B2则从明亮轻盈、恢复弹性与玩心的侧面，表现同一份喜欢带来的沉醉，以及渴望在调情与回应中得到满足。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B3\",\n      \"why\": \"B3描写的是歌声在段内逐渐蒸发、突然中断，以及快乐尚未结束便已开始怀念的转折。S08-1说明了沉醉与满足的由来，却没有直接说明音乐为何在此刻消散，也没有充分解释快乐如何转为对它的怀念。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d5d1baf0-6ff9-41b1-85f3-023c1915db43", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T114149491435Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.5, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T11:43:03.984810+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6eb4e3e366560d6368b34e08c29f06aa5fff5ca1915f64525afd6f840e7c1060", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-a